      "ruled_out_by": "Each type's path, divided by its own change from 0 to 127, agrees with the other two to 0.001 at 32, 0.002 at 48, 0.010 at 95; the repeats of one setting spread by at most 0.010 dB on a change of about two decibels. Three stages would have to share a byte map and a curve to do that, which is one stage reached from three types."
